# Precise cache profile for the OMGRSW4/OMGLOWD/CKIR12 shared-byte-view
# resolution, independent-reference, producer, and backend gates. The producer
# and backend rerun inherited relations, so their directly consumed references
# and fixtures remain dependencies.
